msgid "Rush to a targeted enemy's or party member's location.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Maximum Charges: </ui-edge-color></ui-color><if ($gn68 == 20)><if ($gn72 >= 84)>{3}<else>{2}</if><else>{2}</if><br>Cannot be executed while bound."
