msgid "Rushes target and delivers a lightning attack with a potency of <if ($gn68 == 30)><if ($gn72 >= 94)>{700}<else>{560}</if><else>{560}</if>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Increases <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ninki Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 5<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Raiju Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Cannot be executed while bound."
