msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of <if ($gn68 == 27)><if ($gn72 >= 94)>{500}<else>{440}</if><else>{440}</if>.<br>Can only be executed while in <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Dreadwyrm Trance</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar.<br>※<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ruin III</ui-edge-color></ui-color> changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Astral Impulse</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when requirements for execution are met."
