msgctxt "ActionTransient:25871:0:0"
msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of <if ($gn68 == 33)><if ($gn72 >= 94)>{270}<else>{250}</if><else>{250}</if>."
msgstr "Наносит магический урон без элемента с силой <if ($gn68 == 33)><if ($gn72 >= 94)>{270}<else>{250}</if><else>{250}</if>."

#. ja: 対象とその周囲の敵に無属性範囲魔法攻撃。　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>威力：</ui-edge-color></ui-color><if ($gn68 == 33)><if ($gn72 >= 94)>{140}<else>{130}</if><else>{130}</if>
#. de: Du führst eine elementneutrale magische Attacke auf das Ziel und die Gegner in seiner Nähe aus.<br>Attacke-Wert: <if ($gn68 == 33)><if ($gn72 >= 94)>{140}<else>{130}</if><else>{130}</if>
#. fr: Effectue une attaque magique neutre sur la cible et les ennemis autour.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Puissance<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <if ($gn68 == 33)><if ($gn72 >= 94)>{140}<else>{130}</if><else>{130}</if>
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 33)><if ($gn72 >= 94)>{140}<else>{130}</if><else>{130}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 33 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
